;; gather (FEAT-018 S-B) — fan-in: await each handle, collect results.
;;
;; The join half of the fan-out. Takes the entry list `scatter` returned and, for
;; each entry, awaits it if it is a live mission handle, or passes a settled
;; {"err" reason} marker through unchanged (an item whose spawn failed never
;; spawned a child to await). A crashed child yields its own {"err" ...} map from
;; await-session. So gather returns one result per entry, errors and all — the
;; caller folds over them (errors are data).
;;
;; Args (data/*):
;;   handles — the entry list from scatter (handles and/or {"err" ...} markers).
;;
;; Returns [result | {"err" ...} ...] — one entry per input, in order.
(map (fn [entry]
       (if (err? entry)
         entry
         (tool/await-session {:handle entry})))
     data/handles)
